              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sue Zigler"
            },
            "reviewBody": "DELICIOUS! I like oyster stew but have always had the basic oysters, milk, butter recipe. The veggies and canned milk kick it up to great. Our butcher shop had fresh oysters on sale so I used those instead of canned. My one mistake was getting the large oysters. Small would be better for stew.",
